            6   NAxCoef        - Number of axial coefficients (-)
AxCoefID  AxCd     AxCa     AxCp    AxFDMod   AxVnCOff  AxFDLoFSc
   (-)    (-)      (-)      (-)      (-)       (-)        (-)
    1     0.00000  0.0000   0.0000    0       -1.00000    0.00000    ! Unloaded joints
    2     0.00000  0.0000   0.0000    0       -1.00000    0.00000    ! Pontoon ends    
    3     5.77000  0.0000   0.0000    1        0.045      0.5        ! Upwind   (-X) column base. Suction-side only formulation (AXFDMod = 1)
    4     5.21000  0.0000   0.0000    1        0.045      0.5        ! Downwind (+Y) column base
    5     5.21000  0.0000   0.0000    1        0.045      0.5        ! Downwind (-Y) column base
    6     0.00000  0.0000   0.0000    0       -1.00000    0.00000    ! Central column base 
